 "structural_change": "HD hierarchical CTL successor: preserve CLOSED M7 dsfd_mtp_seq_c at identical source/defaults. Existing cluster_level2 PG M8 / signal M7; glue + four SRAM and real hard sequencer, never flatten sequencer. Zero data or reset cycle change; HSF0 unchanged. Native glue admission and physical clock/reach/PG remain required.",
